          <li><strong>Final connection</strong> -- at the spa's control box</li>
          <li><strong>Inspection coordination</strong> -- schedule and walk through with city inspector</li>
          <li><strong>Walkthrough</strong> -- show you the disconnect, breaker, and GFCI test</li>
        </ol>
